1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
PHANTOM GRID deploys analog front-end active anti-phase noise cancellation.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,500
Under extreme 95.5 dBm broadband RF interference, the engine triggers within 30 picoseconds.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:12,000
An exact 180 degree anti-phase wavefront is synthesized, suppressing noise floor to minus 120 dBm.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Over 215.5 dB attenuation preserves critical sensor and CAN bus signal-to-noise ratio.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
All events are immutably signed with SHA-256 and exposed through vehicle MCP tooling.
